ross domestic product (GDP), at the Bali G20 Leaders' Summit should be successful in producing concrete and useful outcomes for the world, he added. He further said that the international community is paying close attention to the G20 Summit to determine whether it will end in success or failure. The summit, which was held in the resort island of Bali and was attended by a majority of G20 heads of government, should be a success rather than a failure, he added. After officially closing the summit on Wednesday, Indonesia handed over the G20 presidency to India.", "language": "en", "metadata": {"sentence_id": "1"}, "frames": [{"name": "Leadership", "roles": [{"name": "Leader", "filler": "leaders", "idxs": [27, 27]}, {"name": "Governed", "filler": "G20", "idxs": [26, 26]}], "idxs": [27, 27], "activation": "leaders"}, {"name": "Importance", "roles": [{"name": "Factor", "filler": "of upholding international law and the multilateral system", "idxs": [38, 45]}], "idxs": [37, 37], "activation": "importance"}, {"name": "Make_agreement_on_action", "roles": [{"name": "Parties", "filler": "several G20 leaders", "idxs": [25, 27]}, {"name": "Topic", "filler": "on a number of issues , including the importance of upholding international law and the multilateral system as well as handling the economic crisis through global macro - policies", "idxs": [29, 57]}], "idxs": [28, 28], "activation": "agreed"}, {"name": "Quantified_mass", "roles": [{"name": "Individuals", "filler": "of issues", "idxs": [32, 33]}, {"name": "Quantity", "filler": "number", "idxs": [31, 31]}], "idxs": [31, 31], "activation": "number"}, {"name": "Economy", "roles": [{"name": "Economy", "filler": "economic", "idxs": [51, 51]}], "idxs": [51, 51], "activation": "economic"}, {"name": "Interior_profile_relation", "roles": [{"name": "Figure", "filler": "ANTARA", "idxs": [13, 13]}, {"name": "Ground", "filler": "Nusa Dua , Bali", "idxs": [15, 18]}], "idxs": [14, 14], "activation": "in"}, {"name": "Political_locales", "r